     It sounds like input focus is assigned to some other window, so your
keystrokes go somewhere else then you intended.  Have you tried clicking
somewhere in that popup window (outside of those buttons), and then typing
your response?  That should work, but is too annoying to use for regular
play.  You need to either customize your window manager so that focus is
always assigned to any window which contains the mouse pointer, or else
you need to set NetHack's "autofocus" resource.



